[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824034892","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115630#issuecomment-3824034892","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115630","id":3824034892,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j7iRM","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T14:23:18Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T14:23:18Z","body":"An interesting fact is related to operator precedence. This bug occurred because I forgot that the exponentiation operator has a higher precedence than the unary minus operator ([docs](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_basics.html#operators), [code](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a4af1cc7c97b41f819ac2ac519a12804a53b1c/modules/gdscript/gdscript_parser.h#L1437-L1439)).\r\n\r\nIn [Python](https://docs.python.org/3/reference/expressions.html#operator-precedence) and [PHP](https://www.php.net/manual/en/language.operators.precedence.php), the precedence order is the same.\r\n\r\nIn [JavaScript](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Operators/Operator_precedence#table), it's reversed, but their adjacent use without parentheses is prohibited for both literals and identifiers:\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n-1 ** 2\r\n// Uncaught SyntaxError: unparenthesized unary expression can't appear\r\n// on the left-hand side of '**'\r\n-x ** 2\r\n// Uncaught SyntaxError: unparenthesized unary expression can't appear\r\n// on the left-hand side of '**'\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824034892/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824238701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115630#issuecomment-3824238701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115630","id":3824238701,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7j8UBt","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-30T15:09:46Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:09:46Z","body":"We also need to update the syntax highlighting. The built-in editor highlights plus and minus signs in the same color as the numeric part when the sign immediately precedes the numeric part (thus emphasizing that it is part of the literal). This is in contrast to a standalone sign or a binary operator.\r\n\r\nBy comparison, GitHub currently highlights plus and minus signs equally, regardless of their position (emphasizing that they are operators).\r\n\r\n<img width=\"244\" height=\"46\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5905bc07-d890-45dc-9679-a5fc0601ea99\" />\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\n# GDScript\r\ntest(-1 - 1, -1-1, - 1, -1)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# Python\r\ntest(-1 - 1, -1-1, - 1, -1)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```php\r\n// PHP\r\ntest(-1 - 1, -1-1, - 1, -1)\r\n```\r\n\r\n```javascript\r\n// JavaScript\r\ntest(-1 - 1, -1-1, - 1, -1)\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3824238701/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833564566","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115630#issuecomment-3833564566","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115630","id":3833564566,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kf42W","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T08:01:56Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T08:01:56Z","body":"Removed special case from highlighter, unary minuses should look the same as binary now:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"412\" height=\"54\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-02 at 10 01 23\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fcf892a2-a23e-46da-b04d-02a8a6a6a4c6\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3833564566/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]